=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ ZLIB @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt zlib @VERSION@ (compression library) for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt zlib is distributed under the zlib licence.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [ZLIB.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for zlib
    At system startup: to define ZLIB$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:ZLIB$STARTUP.COM
    Building against zlib: compile with /INCLUDE=ZLIB$ROOT:[INCLUDE]
    and link with ZLIB$ROOT:[LIB]LIBZ.OLB/LIBRARY.

PRODUCT REMOVE ZLIB removes the product and deassigns ZLIB$ROOT.
